<title>USA: Alabama Power trust closes sale of preferred.</title>
<headline>Alabama Power trust closes sale of preferred.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alabama Power Co, a unit of Southern Co, said its Alabama Power Capital Trust II has closed the sale of a new, 7.60 percent preferred issue.</p>
<p>Art Beattie, vice president and treasurer, said Alabama Power was also scheduled to redeem in full its 7.60 class A preferred stock, first 1992 series, on February 18 at $25 a share, plus accrued dividends of $0.248 a share.</p>
<p>Alabama Power is an investor-owned electric utility serving 1.2 million customers in the southern Alabama.</p>
</text>
